  "known_open_conflicts_for_user_review": [
    "JCB/Sporttery chat-analysis auxiliary use vs older V2 product removal",
    "Whether corrupt/identity-failed data should be the sole emergency exception to no-PASS",
    "Whether exactly-one-main applies only to full deep analysis or also every raw quick-scan candidate"
